{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2017-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1483228800, "end_date": 1483833599, "month_true_total": 151, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:12:32 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "29101352", "author": {"steamid": "76561198012475643", "personaname": "MikeTheBoss", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Miketheboss33/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 1404, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1134, "last_played": 1630691684, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is not often I enjoy a pixel game over 5 hours, ever. Risk of Rain brings a bunch of good to the table that will have you coming back. I really enjoy my time playing this game and there is very few cons to the game!\n\nPro:\n+AMAZING artwork\n+Out of this world sound track (seriously, artists and sound devs deserve a medal)\n+Few survival games can nail the risk and reward system of grinding out or progressing forward.\n+Plenty of unlockables!\n+Fun bosses!\n+great level designs\n+Best combat I have played in a 2D game\n\nCon:\n-Online play is so laggy and delayed, it's pretty impossible to play with a friend online..\n-Can't use 2 controllers to play locally, just 1 keyboard and 1 controller :(\n\n\nTry this game out, for realz", "timestamp_created": 1483830384, "timestamp_updated": 1483830456, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29099806", "author": {"steamid": "76561197967015030", "personaname": "Max Rebo [gamershots]", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/notmyproblem123/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 3753, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 723, "last_played": 1675644475, "avatar": "b0946a78c850559595900a3698ba4ad6cf7748f9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty exciting, would recommend swallowing your pride and going on easy mode at first, the game is not easy", "timestamp_created": 1483826117, "timestamp_updated": 1483826117, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29085389", "author": {"steamid": "76561198165368099", "personaname": "ALEATORIVM", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198165368099/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 7915, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4149, "last_played": 1699520133, "avatar": "535297e05c1405acc5e85e7ffb377efd15f0ac83"}, "language": "english", "review": "Just...one...more...run...", "timestamp_created": 1483789819, "timestamp_updated": 1483789819, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29083398", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010335843", "personaname": "76561198010335843", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198010335843/", "num_games_owned": 2190, "num_reviews": 329, "playtime_forever": 370, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 361, "last_played": 1653769268, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game but achievements don't work for me. ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ this game.\n\nEdit: The achievements DIDN'T work for me. They work now. I'm still not recommending this game though because it puts me to sleep. Honestly, the biggest problem for me is that the game is way too hard, I can usually only beat 1 or 2 levels before the game becomes insanely difficult. I've never seen the ending for this game but I just don't have the patience for this crap. I'm sure if I poured hundreds of hours into the game I'd eventually get good at it, but why bother if I'm not enjoying any of it? They should have just made the game easy to start out, and then gradually make it harder with the introduction of new stages and items like Binding of Isaac. Instead this game is just balls-to-the-wall hard from start to finish.", "timestamp_created": 1483784006, "timestamp_updated": 1507278074, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.201941728591918945", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "29074080", "author": {"steamid": "76561197969812027", "personaname": "Millenia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/milleniafin/", "num_games_owned": 758, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 4646, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2364, "last_played": 1699381459, "avatar": "f77b021fe59191d313616bb5be3efc8f6c86fe39"}, "language": "english", "review": "Can't recommend it enough.", "timestamp_created": 1483748110, "timestamp_updated": 1483748110, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.616711854934692383", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "